  "review": {
    "gallery": "Three full-size DLD inspection photos from project 2726, inspection album 3632, linked by https://dubaihandover.com/projects/2726-anwa-aria-by-omniyat. The registry groups the images under its 30 September 2026 inspection. Some files have October timestamps, so no exact capture date is assigned. Seven original OMNIYAT renders show the proposed design. Inspection photos and renders are labelled separately in the gallery.",
    "location": "Distinct OMNIYAT ANWA ARIA marker and brochure locator. Named travel times are copied numerically from the brochure’s legend, with route and mode left unspecified. Generic nearest-school and nearest-hospital labels were excluded.",
    "floorPlans": "37 complete embedded ANWA ARIA plan sheets from 19 physical pages of the Dubricks compilation. Both drawings on shared pages retain the original page link. Unit numbers, bedroom headings and printed terrace-inclusive totals were visually checked. Studio headings remain studios even where a generic line on the drawing says one bedroom. The preserved project identity is the protected OMNIYAT launch record. The DLD gallery is cross-referenced by project number 2726, including its subsequent Aria by Beyond name."
  },
  "unavailable": [
    "Surveyed visitor entrance, verified finished-building photography, and complete public plans for the duplexes, townhouses and penthouses."
  ]
